--- rendered ---
error[E-number]: missing digits after the exponent
  --> number.spl:1:10
  |
1 | let a = 1e;
  |          ^ expected digits after `e`
  |
  = help: for example `1e3` or `1e-3`

error[E-number]: number is too large
  --> number.spl:2:9
  |
2 | let b = 1e400;
  |         ^^^^^ beyond the largest representable value

error[E-number]: a number can't start with `.`
  --> number.spl:3:9
  |
3 | let c = .5;
  |         ^^ add a leading zero
  |
  = help: write `0.5`

error[E-number]: a number can't end with `.`
  --> number.spl:4:9
  |
4 | let d = 1.;
  |         ^^ add a digit after the point
  |
  = help: write `1.0`
